  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: Everything feeling smooth? No weird clanking sounds when you hit the brakes?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Just the usual music of a thousand loose bolts. Nothing to worry about.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: "You\u2019re a brave man. Most people would have called a tow truck by
      now, but you just keep rolling."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "It\u2019s a trust exercise between me and the machine."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Hung (Mechanic)
    Text: I respect that. Just bring it in if it stopped singing okay? My tools are
      always ready for you.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
